    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "If this is the last suspension, the coordinator proposes a new time to the group without changing the group’s playback rate.",
      "ko": "[`AVAssetResourceLoadingRequest`](avassetresourceloadingrequest.md)를 로딩 완료하기 전에, 해당 [`contentInformationRequest`](avassetresourceloadingrequest/contentinformationrequest.md)가 `nil`이 아니면 모든 에셋 데이터가 사용 가능함을 나타내도록 값을 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)로 설정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "bc78c4d85777c279c63dd7a513b3943ae77c079a09709e342ff530316d0606d0",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "If it isn’t, the coordinator only proposes the new time after all other suspensions end.",
      "ko": "이는 데이터가 완전히 캐시되어 있거나, 사용자 지정 URL 스킴이 최종적으로 로컬 저장소의 파일을 참조하기 때문에 큰 데이터 흐름 최적화가 가능하므로 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)일 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2f31f25b9a62c8839b91ee83e8d7dc971b091abaa53295574bdb797dbf826f9a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "A suspension that ends after this one ends can override the proposed time.",
      "ko": "역호환성을 위해 이 속성의 기본값은 [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1351d5eec0525e403c9e21bd796358fedf4a3430e127bdc19251eb5ebf07cc81",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "Similarly, playback commands from the group that arrive after this suspension ends, override a pending proposal.",
      "ko": "Similarly, playback commands from the group that arrive after this suspension ends, override a pending proposal.",
      "sourceHash": "24873de4a9eab391e6d69bd45aaf39db513cd910038e1b44a700b05734549db6",
      "status": "failed"
    },
